exports[`drawings CLI > refusals > refuses a numeral outside figures.md and writes no drawing 1`] = `
{
  "exitCode": 1,
  "ok": false,
  "reason": "Every part drawn has a numeral, and every numeral is in the figure list:
- Error \`numeral-not-allowed\` (FIG-1.scene.json): Numeral 98 is not in the figures list (allowed: 10, 12, 202, 204, 206). [37 CFR 1.84(p)(5); OJ EPO 2025 A49 Art. 1(2)(i); PCT Rule 11.13(l)]
Add the part to the figure list (propose when the disclosure does not state it), or remove it from the scene.",
  "wrote": [],
}
`;

